# The video under "The different views" on the navigation guide: open an agent onto the stage,
# then jump the keyboard to the list, the details and back to the agent with the pane picker.
# navigation-views.before fills the panel with three workflows and six haiku agents.
Source recordings/panel.tape
Wait+Screen@60s /help-tags/
Type "j"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+Space
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Type "d"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Space
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Type "f"
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+Space
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Type "j"
